      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is working as intended. Submissions need to have been created/updated after the start of the jam to be considered. \n\nNote that in the past, users were uploading old avatars to new blueprint id's anyways, so there's no way for us to effectively catch who is uploading older content. We will still be manually reviewing all entries.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
