  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-07-15T05:56:00.700Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When submitting content for a jam, there is a limitation that should only allow you to submit content that has been uploaded after the start of the jam. What happens instead is that it allows you to submit content that has been modified after the jam, rather than uploaded. Even just updating metadata (like style tags) will cause it to be allowed to be submitted.\n\nAttached are images of the avatars I am allowed to submit for the jam, which shows the date they were last updated, and a screenshot of one of the details old avatars that has incorrectly been allowed, showing it was originally uploaded in 2022.",
